**3. Target Market & User Personas**

**Target Market**

\[PLATFORM NAME\] targets small to mid-size construction companies in
the United States and Canada, operating in residential and commercial
construction across all major trades. The primary addressable customer
ranges from sole-proprietor contractors to companies with up to 200
field employees and \$50M in annual revenue.

