**Job Type Configuration**

At the project level, each job is configured with a Job Type that shapes
the interface and active features for that project. This allows a single
tenant to run different types of work simultaneously without confusion:

  -----------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Job Type**     **Description**                **Typical User**
  ---------------- ------------------------------ -----------------------
  Self-Perform     Company is running the full    Any trade contractor
  Prime            job with their own crews       running their own
                                                  projects

  GC with Subs     Company is the GC managing     General contractors,
                   subcontracted scopes           construction managers

  Trade Prime      Trade company running a job    Electricians, plumbers,
                   directly as the prime          masons as prime on
                   contractor                     smaller jobs

  Subcontract Work Job originated from a GC       Any trade company
                   assigning scope to this        working under a GC
                   company                        

  Mixed            GC who also self-performs one  GC with in-house
                   or more trade scopes           framing, concrete, or
                                                  sitework crews
