**Free Tier --- Subcontractor Portal**

Non-tenant subcontractors invited to a project by any paying tenant
receive a free limited portal account. This eliminates the adoption
barrier for GCs whose subs are not yet on the platform, and creates an
organic conversion funnel --- subs experience the platform value through
project participation and convert to paid tenants when ready.

Free portal users can: view their assigned scope and schedule, submit
invoices for approval, upload submittals and respond to RFIs, submit
daily field reports, view inspection results, and communicate through
the project message thread. They cannot access company-level features,
manage their own independent projects, run financials, or use
trade-specific workflows without upgrading to a paid subscription.

